      "refersTo": "tabs-list",
      "description": "Capsule track with a sliding card-white thumb.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-seg\"><span class=\"ds-seg-thumb\"></span><button class=\"ds-seg-tab ds-on\">Small</button><button class=\"ds-seg-tab\">Medium</button><button class=\"ds-seg-tab\">Large</button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-seg{position:relative;isolation:isolate;display:inline-flex;height:36px;padding:2px;border-radius:9999px;background:var(--secondary)}.ds-seg-thumb{position:absolute;z-index:-1;top:2px;left:2px;height:32px;width:72px;border-radius:9999px;background:var(--card);box-shadow:0 1px 3px oklch(.2 .02 260/.14),0 0 0 .5px oklch(.2 .02 260/.06);transition:left 500ms var(--ease-spring)}.ds-seg-tab{width:72px;border:0;border-radius:9999px;background:none;color:var(--muted-foreground);font:500 13px/1 var(--font-sans,system-ui);cursor:pointer}.ds-seg-tab:hover,.ds-seg-tab.ds-on{color:var(--foreground)}.ds-seg-tab:focus-visible{outline:none;box-shadow:0 0 0 3px var(--ring)}"
